  "details": "When migrating my world to the Unity 6 beta, one of my textures was imported incorrectly.\n\nThe affected texture uses the **R8_UInt** format (single-channel, 8-bit unsigned integer). After upgrading the project to Unity 6, this texture was no longer imported or interpreted correctly, even though it worked as expected in the previous Unity version.\n\nThis issue breaks my world generator, which relies on this texture format to function correctly.\n\nIt appears that this specific texture format is not being migrated correctly during the project upgrade process.",
